cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. A paper describing this
  benchmark is in preparation; this file will be updated with the paper's
  reference once it is published.
title: "Vietnamese Seq2Seq QA Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Fine-tuning and evaluation pipeline benchmarking five encoder-decoder models
  (ViT5, BARTpho-syllable, mBART-large-50, ByT5-small, mT5-base) on Vietnamese
  question answering, with and without context.
